<title>PHILIPPINES: Alsons to start chemical unit.</title>
<headline>Alsons to start chemical unit.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alsons Consolidated Resources Inc has set up a firm to make chemicals used in building construction material, documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>Alsons Construction Chemicals Inc will manufacture and sell all kinds of admixtures for cement, concrete and sealing compounds.</p>
<p>The new company wil have an authorised capital of 50 million pesos, and a paid-up capital of 12.5 million pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
